{"1018720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "X-POINT", "steam_appid": 1018720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ IMPORTANT WARNING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X-POINT IS NOT A CASUAL GAME.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no simplified tutorial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no quick victories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no “press a button - get fun” principle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake has fatal consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are not ready to put in the effort to learn, this game is not for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 ABOUT X-POINT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep, hardcore hybrid of global RTS and third-person simulator. Features include commanding from a satellite, controlling units in air, land, and sea with realistic physics, and a, &quot;war correspondent&quot; camera mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❌ WHAT TO EXPECT</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a casual shooter or quick-session game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steep learning curve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A challenging, uncompromising experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ WHO THIS GAME IS FOR</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who appreciate:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex strategic systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-stakes, irreversible decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep tactical mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy overcoming steep challenges, this is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 PROJECT PHILOSOPHY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A niche, intentionally demanding game designed for strategic depth and scale.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ IMPORTANT WARNING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X-POINT IS NOT A CASUAL GAME.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no simplified tutorial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no quick victories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no “press a button - get fun” principle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake has fatal consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are not ready to put in the effort to learn, this game is not for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 ABOUT X-POINT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep, hardcore hybrid of global RTS and third-person simulator. Features include commanding from a satellite, controlling units in air, land, and sea with realistic physics, and a, &quot;war correspondent&quot; camera mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❌ WHAT TO EXPECT</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a casual shooter or quick-session game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steep learning curve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A challenging, uncompromising experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ WHO THIS GAME IS FOR</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who appreciate:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex strategic systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-stakes, irreversible decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep tactical mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy overcoming steep challenges, this is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 PROJECT PHILOSOPHY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A niche, intentionally demanding game designed for strategic depth and scale.</p>", "short_description": "X-POINT is an uncompromising RTS and 3rd-person simulator. Total control: from the satellite map to direct handling of infantry, tanks, and nuclear aircraft carriers. The game requires deep analysis and forgives no tactical errors. Looking for an easy game? This is not for you.", "supported_languages": "Englis